@c APPENDICES
@node Version History
@appendix Version History

@table @dfn
@item Version 0.4.0, July 05, 2025
@itemize
@item
@code{api} command: The @code{source} argument is now called
@code{sources} and accepts one or more paths to Guile Scheme
modules or Guile Scheme directories. For example:

@example
$ documenta api libx.scm
$ documenta api liby
$ documenta api "libz.scm libz"
@end example

@item
@code{api} command: The @code{destination} argument, which was a
positional argument, became a keyword argument called
@code{--destination}, and abbreviated as @code{-d}.
@end itemize

@item Version 0.3.0, June 22, 2025
@itemize
@item
Macros are now documented with name, arguments and documentation
strings instead of simply copied verbatim to the exported
documentation.
@item
Added support to document parameter objects. Module documentation
sections now include a "Parameters" subsection if they export
parameters. The parameters are also listed in the "Variable Index".
@end itemize

@item Version 0.2.1, Oct 16, 2023
@itemize
@item
Enable installing Guile Documentá from the package provided by my
personal Guix Channel X. Two unit tests that pass in Guile Documentá's
development environment (which uses Guix shell) were failing when
building the package with Guix. Both tests were marked as expected
fails to make the test suite pass regardless of the issues and be able
to install the package successfully. This is a temporary fix until the
origin of the issues is found.
@end itemize

@item Version 0.2.0, May 31, 2023
@itemize
@item
Rename @command{extract} command to @command{api} so that it is
easier to separate API documentation and CLI documentation extraction.
@item
Add project website.
@end itemize

@item Version 0.1.0, April 13, 2023
@itemize
@item
Initial release of the software providing a program to generate API
documentation of Guile Scheme libraries in Texinfo format.
@end itemize
@end table



